    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d87">

                <pb facs="0204" n="100" xml:id="pg100"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/1571.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Chargé d’Affaires.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 28, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Informally express to Mr. Lou my thanks for his congratulations, and add that
                    this Government is giving careful and sympathetic consideration to the question
                    of recognition of the Republic.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
